{"baseline":{"amendments":[],"id":"sensor-fan-harness-03-basis","requirements":[{"id":"HARNESS03-TOPOLOGY","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/03-dual-zone-air-sampler/wiring-schedule.csv","locator":"all rows","sha256":"afa70bb2fd7c8966b67b8fd12c9e393130f074b02e38d347fc200387aa21a7a5"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/03-dual-zone-air-sampler/context.md","locator":"Pin conventions and separation; Route model","sha256":"515cd8b13ac15172e920eccffaf16ab06194c38441486e699854c8047d1fb485"}],"text":"The harness preserves every declared J0/ZX/ZY/load pin and net; fan returns and each zone sensor return remain separate until the external controller star point."},{"id":"HARNESS03-RESERVE","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/03-dual-zone-air-sampler/connector-requirements.csv","locator":"reserved_pins","sha256":"c99a3f80838ffdad7aed01d389599498166ec9b99c5e17ba6471e434c5982a83"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/03-dual-zone-air-sampler/context.md","locator":"Pin conventions and separation","sha256":"515cd8b13ac15172e920eccffaf16ab06194c38441486e699854c8047d1fb485"}],"text":"Pin 6 at both ZX and ZY is explicitly marked reserve/unconnected and is not bonded to ground or any other net."},{"id":"HARNESS03-SHIELDS","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/03-dual-zone-air-sampler/context.md","locator":"Pin conventions and separation","sha256":"515cd8b13ac15172e920eccffaf16ab06194c38441486e699854c8047d1fb485"}],"text":"Each pressure signal/return uses a shielded twisted pair whose drain bonds only at the controller chassis termination and is neither a load return nor protective earth."},{"id":"HARNESS03-CURRENTS","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/03-dual-zone-air-sampler/wiring-schedule.csv","locator":"current_cont_A,current_start_A","sha256":"afa70bb2fd7c8966b67b8fd12c9e393130f074b02e38d347fc200387aa21a7a5"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/03-dual-zone-air-sampler/context.md","locator":"Business and electrical configuration; Route model","sha256":"515cd8b13ac15172e920eccffaf16ab06194c38441486e699854c8047d1fb485"}],"text":"Shared segments use the summed simultaneous startup currents, including 3.28 A on common +24V, 3.20 A on common FAN_RETURN and 1.64 A per zone supply."},{"id":"HARNESS03-DROP","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/03-dual-zone-air-sampler/allowed-wire.csv","locator":"all rows","sha256":"dc791d7c6604503f1921ccf5bc2a882a1c95c923ae3abb5a249176ce696f8461"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/03-dual-zone-air-sampler/wiring-schedule.csv","locator":"all power/return rows","sha256":"afa70bb2fd7c8966b67b8fd12c9e393130f074b02e38d347fc200387aa21a7a5"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/03-dual-zone-air-sampler/context.md","locator":"Fabrication capability and policies","sha256":"515cd8b13ac15172e920eccffaf16ab06194c38441486e699854c8047d1fb485"}],"text":"Every fan and sensor branch remains at or below 0.72 V in separate continuous and simultaneous-start cases using all shared/branch supply and return segments at 50 °C."},{"id":"HARNESS03-SPLICES","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/03-dual-zone-air-sampler/context.md","locator":"Route model","sha256":"515cd8b13ac15172e920eccffaf16ab06194c38441486e699854c8047d1fb485"}],"text":"Each load-side +24V split uses a documented permissible two-conductor terminal or an explicit located splice; no unapproved double-crimp is assumed."},{"id":"HARNESS03-CUT-LENGTHS","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/03-dual-zone-air-sampler/wiring-schedule.csv","locator":"route_mm","sha256":"afa70bb2fd7c8966b67b8fd12c9e393130f074b02e38d347fc200387aa21a7a5"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/03-dual-zone-air-sampler/context.md","locator":"Fabrication capability and policies","sha256":"515cd8b13ac15172e920eccffaf16ab06194c38441486e699854c8047d1fb485"}],"text":"The cut list uses unique centerline routes, 50 mm connector service allowances plus documented strip/crimp allowance, and does not double-count shared trunks."},{"id":"HARNESS03-CONNECTORS","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/03-dual-zone-air-sampler/connector-requirements.csv","locator":"all rows","sha256":"c99a3f80838ffdad7aed01d389599498166ec9b99c5e17ba6471e434c5982a83"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/03-dual-zone-air-sampler/context.md","locator":"Service and process controls; Fabrication capability and policies","sha256":"515cd8b13ac15172e920eccffaf16ab06194c38441486e699854c8047d1fb485"}],"text":"Selected sourced connector/terminal/tool combinations meet pin counts, 30 V, 50 °C derating, at least 4 A at J0, 2 A at ZX/ZY power contacts and 0.1 A at sensor contacts."},{"id":"HARNESS03-SERVICE","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/03-dual-zone-air-sampler/context.md","locator":"Service and process controls","sha256":"515cd8b13ac15172e920eccffaf16ab06194c38441486e699854c8047d1fb485"}],"text":"Zone X is blue, Zone Y orange, cross-connection prevention is justified, bend radius is at least 40 mm, abrasion points are sleeved, and motor-cable spacing is at least 50 mm."},{"id":"HARNESS03-TEST-INSTRUCTIONS","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"content","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/03-dual-zone-air-sampler/context.md","locator":"Service and process controls","sha256":"515cd8b13ac15172e920eccffaf16ab06194c38441486e699854c8047d1fb485"}],"text":"Assembly instructions include continuity tests while clearly stating that no electrical test was performed."},{"id":"HARNESS03-DELIVERABLES","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"content","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/03-dual-zone-air-sampler/prompt.txt","locator":"requested outputs","sha256":"cc34a9c33a3bbc09233896412b3d02ab0c96d6494236e465152fb51600140133"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/03-dual-zone-air-sampler/context.md","locator":"Outputs","sha256":"515cd8b13ac15172e920eccffaf16ab06194c38441486e699854c8047d1fb485"}],"text":"The output set contains labeled harness plan, exact pin schedule, cut list, BOM, illustrated assembly instructions and voltage-drop evidence."},{"id":"HARNESS03-ACTION-SCOPE","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"content","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/03-dual-zone-air-sampler/context.md","locator":"Business and electrical configuration; Fabrication capability and policies","sha256":"515cd8b13ac15172e920eccffaf16ab06194c38441486e699854c8047d1fb485"}],"text":"The result is instrumentation design only, claims no machinery safety function or production certification, and performs no energizi